355a42eec0f0e927e80ab0","speaker":"Dave","turn_index":17}],"speaker":null,"store_id":"s3","store_snapshot_sha256":"983238fddc77a88ef4ae3d06b50bcfd25a429f497e89c6af4d9477cefca9cad2","text":"- On 2023-09-22, caught up with Dave (\"Hey Calvin, good to catch up again!\"): Dave told him he'd been working on the engine of the vintage Mustang — thought he'd fixed it, but when he started it up he heard a weird noise — \"So disappointing after putting so much work in\" — and asked Calvin to look at the engine (photo of a car engine with a small engine; details in the Car mod workshop (2023-08-11) section of /memories/dave.md); Calvin sympathized — \"sorry to hear about the car trouble. That must be disappointing after putting so much work into it. Yeah, fixing cars can be tricky.\" — then shared a photo of his red sports car (Ferrari) parked in a parking lot: \"It's a sign of my hard work and dedication. Looking at it reminds me how far I've come.\" (details in ## New luxury car (Ferrari, 2023-03-26)); Dave: \"I love the way the sunlight hits this. It's definitely a great symbol of all your hard work. I bet you feel really proud when you look at it.\" and asked if there were any special memories with it; Calvin: an amazing drive \"one summer day\" — \"The wind blowing through my hair and the rush of freedom - it was unforgettable\" — and he's \"pondered the intricacies of life, taking a moment to truly appreciate the path I've chosen and the decisions that have shaped my journey\"; also said his trip to Japan was incredible — \"the culture, the people, everything was so cool\" — \"I'm already longing to go back, it was an experience that made all the hard work worth it.\" (details in ## Japan plan); Dave: \"Wow, Calvin, that's awesome! That feeling of freedom in the summer is the best. A moment of reflection not only makes the journey interesting but also productive!\" and asked whether any song from Calvin's childhood brings back memories; Calvin: \"there's this one song that always makes me smile. It played during a road trip with my dad and we had so much fun singing along to it.\"; Dave: \"Sounds awesome, Calvin! Road trips with family are always a treat. What's the name of the song?\"; Calvin: \"We used to rock a song by Tupac and Dr. Dre called 'California Love.' Ah, those were the days!\" (details in ## Music); Dave: \"Sounds great, Cal! 'California Love' is a classic! Let me know if you wanna jam some music together!\"; Calvin: \"Yeah, let's do it! That would be awesome.\" — the two are now planning to jam some music together; Dave: \"I'm stoked, Calvin! We can crank up the music and have an awesome jam session. Can't wait!\"; Calvin: \"Yeah, Dave! Gonna be great! Can't wait to see what we can do.\"; Dave: \"Yeah, let's do it! It'll be awesome. Let's rock it!\"; Calvin: \"Yeah, let's do this! I can't wait!\"; the conversation closed with Dave: \"Nice one, Calvin! Let's make some awesome memories and have a great time. See ya soon!\", and Calvin: \"Count me in. Can't wait to create something special. See you soon!\", and Dave's final parting: \"Yep, Calvin! Can't wait to see you soon. Take it easy till then.\" [S20T1][S20T2][S20T3][S20T4][S20T5][S20T6][S20T7][S20T8][S20T9][S20T10][S20T11][S20T12][S20T13][S20T14][S20T15][S20T16][S20T17].","text_sha256":"c9171473e1d7e2e6866f3eb34d5f7ef58558a570e6115ddc8f5b6946ac3a56ed","timestamp":"2023-09-22T20:57:00"},{"attribution_index_sha256":"98109144a5a23da7a5b89634be2c543ea2366f2abe85f1f3f8a3df64a5e92ce2","attribution_units":[{"dia_ids":["D12:2"],"kind":"curated_fact","line_end":77,"line_start":77,"source_locators":["[S12T2]"],"text_sha256":"5234b159f96aebf277bc12dcbebfd4711d00e72932f09021929f125ecf024ff1"}],"dia_ids":["D12:2"],"evidence_id":"ev-d33ebcb687be896e9483a4bcf7b6f6db4c8b45d5400a6eaa0e9d290d3e00af19","group_id":"/memories/dave.md > # Dave","line_end":77,"line_start":77,"observation_ids":["obs-0003"],"path":"/memories/dave.md","query_terms":[],"rank":null,"records_sha256":"130a5a1